## 1. Admin Section

### 1.1 Login
POST http://localhost:8083/admin/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "",
    "password": "",
    "rememberMe": true
}

### 1.2 Signup (Create Admin User via API)
POST http://localhost:8083/admin/users
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ADMIN_TOKEN_HERE
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "firstname": "",
    "lastname": "",
    "email": "",
    "roles": [1]
}

### 1.3 Forgot Password (Admin)
POST http://localhost:8083/admin/forgot-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": ""
}

### 1.3.1 Reset Password (Admin)
POST http://localhost:8083/admin/reset-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "code": "",
    "password": "",
    "passwordConfirmation": ""
}

### 1.4 Profile
GET http://localhost:8083/admin/users/me
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ADMIN_TOKEN_HERE

### 1.5 Logout (Admin)
POST http://localhost:8083/admin/logout
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ADMIN_TOKEN_HERE


# ==============================================================================
## 2. User Section
# ==============================================================================

### 2.1 Signup / Register (User)
POST http://localhost:8083/api/auth/local/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "",
    "email": "",
    "password": ""
}

### 2.2 Login (User)
POST http://localhost:8083/api/auth/local
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "identifier": "",
    "password": ""
}

### 2.3 Profile (Get Me)
GET http://localhost:8083/api/users/me
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_USER_TOKEN_HERE

### 2.4 Update Profile (Edit Me)
PUT http://localhost:8083/api/users/me
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_USER_TOKEN_HERE
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "",
    "email": "",
    "firstname": "",
    "lastname": ""
}

### 2.5 Change Password
POST http://localhost:8083/api/auth/change-password
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_USER_TOKEN_HERE
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "currentPassword": "",
    "password": "",
    "passwordConfirmation": ""
}

### 2.6 Forgot Password (User)
POST http://localhost:8083/api/auth/forgot-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": ""
}

### 2.7 Reset Password (User)
POST http://localhost:8083/api/auth/reset-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "code": "",
    "password": "",
    "passwordConfirmation": ""
}

### 2.8 Email Confirmation
GET http://localhost:8083/api/auth/email-confirmation?confirmation=CONFIRMATION_CODE_FROM_EMAIL

### 2.9 Resend Email Confirmation
POST http://localhost:8083/api/auth/send-email-confirmation
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": ""
}

### 2.10 Logout (User)
POST http://localhost:8083/api/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_USER_TOKEN_HERE

### 2.11 Refresh Token
POST http://localhost:8083/api/auth/refresh-token
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "refreshToken": ""
}

### 2.12 Delete Account (PDPA / Right to be Forgotten)
DELETE http://localhost:8083/api/users/me
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_USER_TOKEN_HERE


# ==============================================================================
## 3. Security & CIA Hardening (คะแนนพิเศษด้าน Cyber Security)
# ==============================================================================

### 3.1 Availability: Service Health Check
GET http://localhost:8083/_health

### 3.2 Authorization: RBAC Get Roles (Admin Only)
GET http://localhost:8083/api/users-permissions/roles
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ADMIN_TOKEN_HERE

### 3.3 Negative Test (Confidentiality): Unauthorized Access (คาดหวัง 403 Forbidden)
GET http://localhost:8083/api/users/me

### 3.4 Negative Test (Integrity): Privilege Escalation (คาดหวัง 401 Unauthorized)
GET http://localhost:8083/admin/users/me
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_USER_TOKEN_HERE

### 3.5 Negative Test (Availability): Brute Force Simulation (คาดหวัง 400 Bad Request)
POST http://localhost:8083/api/auth/local
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "identifier": "",
    "password": ""
}
